["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>A deer that sees you first is gone. Expensive camo is not the answer: outline, flash, shadow, skyline and above all movement give you away. Fix those and plain wool works.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Six ways a hunter gets seen: shape, shine, shadow, silhouette, spacing and movement. Movement is number one.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Six ways you get seen</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"175\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Shape</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"102\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#868e96\" text-anchor=\"start\">outline</text><rect x=\"210\" y=\"50\" width=\"175\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"226\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Shine</text><text x=\"226\" y=\"102\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#868e96\" text-anchor=\"start\">flash</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"130\" width=\"175\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Shadow</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"182\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#868e96\" text-anchor=\"start\">dark shapes</text><rect x=\"210\" y=\"130\" width=\"175\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"226\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Silhouette</text><text x=\"226\" y=\"182\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#868e96\" text-anchor=\"start\">skyline</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"210\" width=\"175\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"240\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Spacing</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"262\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#868e96\" text-anchor=\"start\">even gaps</text><rect x=\"210\" y=\"210\" width=\"175\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"226\" y=\"240\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Movement</text><text x=\"226\" y=\"262\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#868e96\" text-anchor=\"start\">number 1</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Six ways you get seen. Movement is number one (Tip).</li><li>Pattern and stillness beat colour <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what this lesson adds</summary><ul><li>How deer see and why: <a href=\"#/s/deer-mind/0\">Deer senses and mind</a>. How to move: <a href=\"#/s/still-hunting/0\">Moving quietly</a> and <a href=\"#/s/stalking-footwork/0\">Stalking footwork</a>.</li><li>The six words come from military concealment teaching: the Australian Army lists shape, shine, shadow and silhouette among its \"Seven S's of Tactical Concealment\"; older guides add spacing and movement (70%, Australian Army CoVE and older field guides, search preview). Using them for hunting is Tip.</li><li>Scent and sound are the other two ways: see <a href=\"#/s/wind-mastery/0\">Wind mastery</a> and Moving quietly.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Fix</th><th>How (Tip)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Shape</td><td>Brush in front, tree behind, sit low</td></tr><tr><td>Shine</td><td>Mask or paint, matte gear, glasses in shade</td></tr><tr><td>Shadow</td><td>Sit in shade, watch where yours falls</td></tr><tr><td>Silhouette</td><td>Never on a skyline</td></tr><tr><td>Spacing</td><td>Two hunters move one at a time</td></tr><tr><td>Movement</td><td>Move when heads are down, freeze when up</td></tr><tr><td>Colour</td><td>Avoid blue; orange looks dull to deer <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the key points in full</summary><ol><li>Deer have two cone types, not three, and lack the long wavelength \"red\" cone: likely red green colour blind like some people (75%, National Deer Association on the University of Georgia study, Jacobs and others).</li><li>They likely tell blue from red, but not green from red or orange from red <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>. Clothing in green, red or orange is equal to them; blue is a disadvantage <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>\"The actual color of the fabric is relatively unimportant as long as the pattern blends with your surroundings.\" (75%, NDA)</li><li>Scent and movement matter far more than clothing colour or UV brighteners (75%, NDA).</li><li>Deer lack the UV filter in the human eye and see UV better than we do, but poorer fine detail (75%, NDA). A 2014 behaviour study found some UV sensitivity (70%, Wildlife Society Bulletin, search preview).</li><li>More rods than people: better night vision, poorer daytime colour vision (75%, NDA).</li></ol></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"6\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>The six, one at a time</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 6</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Left: a clear human shape stands in the open. Right: the same shape broken up by brush in front and beside it.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Shape</text><g transform=\"translate(110 220) scale(1.6)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><text x=\"110\" y=\"275\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Clear human shape</text><g transform=\"translate(290 220) scale(1.6)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(270 190) scale(1.1)\"><circle cx=\"-14\" cy=\"-10\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"-4\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(320 215) scale(0.9)\"><circle cx=\"-14\" cy=\"-10\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"-4\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/></g><text x=\"290\" y=\"275\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Broken by brush</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\"></text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>1.</b> Shape: break up your outline with brush.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Left: a bare face with glasses throws a bright flash of sun. Right: a masked, matte face in shade gives no flash.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Shine</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"150\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#e8c4a0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"95\" y=\"135\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dfe8f0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"123\" y=\"135\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dfe8f0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"158.0\" y1=\"132.0\" x2=\"170.0\" y2=\"132.0\" stroke=\"#f2c70c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"152.72792206135784\" y1=\"144.72792206135784\" x2=\"161.21320343559643\" y2=\"153.21320343559643\" stroke=\"#f2c70c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140.0\" y1=\"150.0\" x2=\"140.0\" y2=\"162.0\" stroke=\"#f2c70c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"127.27207793864214\" y1=\"144.72792206135784\" x2=\"118.78679656440357\" y2=\"153.21320343559643\" stroke=\"#f2c70c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"122.0\" y1=\"132.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"132.0\" stroke=\"#f2c70c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"127.27207793864214\" y1=\"119.27207793864214\" x2=\"118.78679656440357\" y2=\"110.78679656440357\" stroke=\"#f2c70c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"140.0\" y1=\"114.0\" x2=\"140.0\" y2=\"102.0\" stroke=\"#f2c70c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"152.72792206135784\" y1=\"119.27207793864214\" x2=\"161.21320343559643\" y2=\"110.78679656440357\" stroke=\"#f2c70c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"230\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Face, glasses, gun</text><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"150\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"230\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Mask, matte, shade</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\"></text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> Shine: kill the flash from face, glasses and gun.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A hunter in low sun throws a long moving shadow across the ground. Another sits inside a shaded timber edge and blends in.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Shadow</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"60\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M0 250 L400 250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"70\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#f2c70c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(140 240) scale(1.2)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><path d=\"M140 248 L290 252 L290 258 L140 252 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"282\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">long moving shadow</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"60\" width=\"100\" height=\"190\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#4d5a40\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\" opacity=\".5\"/><g transform=\"translate(350 240) scale(1.2)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#3a4430\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#3a4430\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><text x=\"350\" y=\"280\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Sit in shade</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\"></text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Shadow: sit in shade, watch where yours falls.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A hunter standing on a ridge top is skylined against the sky. Another stands below the crest with hillside behind him and blends in.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Silhouette</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"60\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#e7f0f7\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M0 200 L200 120 L400 200 L400 250 L0 250 Z\" fill=\"#c9d3b8\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g transform=\"translate(200 120) scale(1.1)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><text x=\"110\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Skylined</text><g transform=\"translate(300 185) scale(1.0)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><text x=\"330\" y=\"230\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Below the crest</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\"></text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>4.</b> Silhouette: never on the skyline.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Evenly spaced objects look man made while nature is random. Two hunters side by side make two shapes; move one at a time.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Spacing</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Even rows look man made</text><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"60,116.4 48.0,150 72.0,150\"/><rect x=\"57.6\" y=\"150\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"100,116.4 88.0,150 112.0,150\"/><rect x=\"97.6\" y=\"150\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"140,116.4 128.0,150 152.0,150\"/><rect x=\"137.6\" y=\"150\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"180,116.4 168.0,150 192.0,150\"/><rect x=\"177.6\" y=\"150\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><text x=\"220\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Nature is random</text><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"230,116.4 218.0,150 242.0,150\"/><rect x=\"227.6\" y=\"150\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"250,106.4 238.0,140 262.0,140\"/><rect x=\"247.6\" y=\"140\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"300,126.4 288.0,160 312.0,160\"/><rect x=\"297.6\" y=\"160\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"340,111.4 328.0,145 352.0,145\"/><rect x=\"337.6\" y=\"145\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(110 250) scale(0.7)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(170 250) scale(0.7)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><text x=\"140\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Side by side: two shapes</text><g transform=\"translate(260 250) scale(0.7)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><text x=\"330\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">One moves at a time</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\"></text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>5.</b> Spacing: two hunters, one shape at a time.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A deer with its head down feeding: move. A deer with its head up looking: freeze.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Movement</text><g transform=\"translate(110 170)\"><ellipse rx=\"30\" ry=\"13\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M20 -6 L34 22 L46 26 L28 4 Z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"44\" cy=\"22\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"6\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M40 17 l-4 -9 M46 17 l2 -10\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M-18 9 v22 M-9 9 v22 M14 9 v22 M21 9 v22\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/></g><text x=\"120\" y=\"240\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Head down: move</text><g transform=\"translate(280 170)\"><ellipse rx=\"30\" ry=\"13\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M20 -6 L34 -48 L46 -44 L28 4 Z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"44\" cy=\"-48\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"6\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M40 -53 l-4 -9 M46 -53 l2 -10\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M-18 9 v22 M-9 9 v22 M14 9 v22 M21 9 v22\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/></g><text x=\"290\" y=\"240\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Head up: freeze</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\"></text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>6.</b> Movement: head down, move. Head up, freeze.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><ul><li>Run through the six every time you sit (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the six in full</summary><ul><li><strong>Shape:</strong> a person's outline, head and shoulders above a straight body, is what animals learn to fear (Tip). Brush in front, a tree behind, sit or kneel to lose the vertical line (Tip).</li><li><strong>Shine:</strong> skin, glasses, rifle bluing, scope lenses and phone screens flash in low sun (Tip). Face mask or paint, gloves, matte finishes, a scope cover, glasses in the shade of a brim (Tip). Binocular glare: see <a href=\"#/s/glassing/0\">Glassing</a>.</li><li><strong>Shadow:</strong> your shadow moves when you move and stretches long at dawn and dusk (Tip). Sit inside shade, not at its edge (Tip).</li><li><strong>Silhouette:</strong> a figure on a ridge against the sky is visible a long way (Tip). Cross ridges at a low spot, crawl the last metres, glass from below the crest (Tip).</li><li><strong>Spacing:</strong> even, regular shapes look man made; nature is random (70%, military concealment teaching). Two hunters side by side are two shapes; move one at a time (Tip).</li><li><strong>Movement:</strong> deer have \"an amazing ability to detect movement\" (75%, NDA, hunter consensus). Move when the head is down or behind cover; freeze when it looks (Tip; see Moving quietly).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two colour bars. Your bar runs blue, green, yellow, orange, red. The deer bar, an approximate drawing, keeps blue bright but turns green, orange and red into dull browns and greys.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">What a deer likely sees (approximate)</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">You</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"150\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Deer</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"50\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#3b5bdb\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"130\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#3b5bdb\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"118\" y=\"50\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#1c7ed6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"118\" y=\"130\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#4c6ef5\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"50\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#2f9e44\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"130\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#8f9c9c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"194\" y=\"50\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#94d82d\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"194\" y=\"130\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#a5a99a\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"232\" y=\"50\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#fab005\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"232\" y=\"130\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b0ab8c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"50\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#fd7e14\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"130\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#a7a28a\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"308\" y=\"50\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"308\" y=\"130\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#9c9784\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"346\" y=\"50\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"346\" y=\"130\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#8e8a7c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">blue</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">orange</text><text x=\"363\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">red</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"210\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Blue stands out. Orange and red look dull,</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"228\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">like browns and greys (75%).</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"265\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#868e96\" text-anchor=\"start\">A drawing, not a measurement (Tip).</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Blue pops. Orange, red and green look like dull browns and greys <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>The drawing is an illustration, not a measurement (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: colour in full</summary><ul><li>Two cone pigments: short wavelength sensitivity around 450 to 460 nm (blue) and middle wavelength around 537 nm in white tailed deer (75%, Jacobs and others, via search previews).</li><li>Missing the long wavelength cone: red and orange fall in a range deer barely separate from green and brown <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Blue jeans and blue jackets are a bad idea (75%, NDA: \"disadvantaged in blue\").</li><li>Mule deer were not in these studies. Assumption: similar, as both are deer (Tip).</li><li>Deeper detail: <a href=\"#/s/deer-mind/0\">Deer senses and mind</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The same hunter in a blaze orange toque and vest seen two ways: to another hunter the orange is bright; to a deer it likely looks dull, close to brown or grey.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Same hunter, two viewers</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"170\" height=\"200\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"50\" width=\"170\" height=\"200\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#c9c6b8\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><g transform=\"translate(105 200)\"><circle cy=\"-62\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#ff6d00\"/><rect x=\"-16\" y=\"-50\" width=\"32\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ff6d00\"/><path d=\"M-8 -4 L-12 34 M8 -4 L12 34\" stroke=\"#4a4030\" stroke-width=\"7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(295 200)\"><circle cy=\"-62\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#9c9784\"/><rect x=\"-16\" y=\"-50\" width=\"32\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#9c9784\"/><path d=\"M-8 -4 L-12 34 M8 -4 L12 34\" stroke=\"#4a4030\" stroke-width=\"7\"/></g><text x=\"105\" y=\"280\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Another hunter: bright</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"280\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#868e96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">A deer: dull (75%)</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Orange looks dull to a deer but bright to other hunters <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Wear it walking in and out, and when others hunt nearby (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: blaze orange in full</summary><ul><li>BC rule: the Hunt Mentor Rule Book lists no blaze orange clothing rule for BC hunters (85%, my reading). <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> in the synopsis before relying on it.</li><li>Other places do require it (New Brunswick, Washington State, Missouri), so check the rules when you hunt outside BC (85%, those regulations, search preview). See the trip lessons.</li><li>Deer see orange as dull, close to brown or grey; motion and outline give you away, not the colour (75%, see Deer senses and mind).</li><li>Tip: an orange toque and vest for walking, packed away when you sit in a safe spot with no other hunters around. Wrap a carried deer or turkey in orange.</li><li>Firearm safety with your brother: <a href=\"#/s/firearm-safety/0\">Firearm safety</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation: low sun, a hunter with glasses turns his head and a bright flash leaps off the lenses twice. A deer below lifts its head: seen.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">One turn of the head</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"50\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#f2c70c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"170\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#e8c4a0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"197\" y=\"155\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dfe8f0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"224\" y=\"155\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dfe8f0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;0;0;1;0\" keyTimes=\"0;.3;.35;.45;.65;.7;.8\" dur=\"6s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><line x1=\"246.0\" y1=\"160.0\" x2=\"272.0\" y2=\"160.0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"244.12435565298213\" y1=\"167.0\" x2=\"266.6410161513775\" y2=\"180.0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"239.0\" y1=\"172.12435565298213\" x2=\"252.0\" y2=\"194.64101615137753\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"232.0\" y1=\"174.0\" x2=\"232.0\" y2=\"200.0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"225.0\" y1=\"172.12435565298213\" x2=\"212.0\" y2=\"194.64101615137756\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"219.87564434701787\" y1=\"167.0\" x2=\"197.35898384862244\" y2=\"180.0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"218.0\" y1=\"160.0\" x2=\"192.0\" y2=\"160.0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"219.87564434701787\" y1=\"153.0\" x2=\"197.35898384862247\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"225.0\" y1=\"147.87564434701787\" x2=\"211.99999999999997\" y2=\"125.35898384862247\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"232.0\" y1=\"146.0\" x2=\"232.0\" y2=\"120.0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"239.0\" y1=\"147.87564434701787\" x2=\"252.0\" y2=\"125.35898384862246\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"244.12435565298213\" y1=\"153.0\" x2=\"266.6410161513775\" y2=\"139.99999999999997\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(340 240) scale(0.9 0.9)\"><ellipse rx=\"20\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M14 -5 L22 -18 L28 -17 L24 -6 Z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"-19\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M-12 6 v14 M-6 6 v14 M10 6 v14 M15 6 v14\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"4.3s\" dur=\".3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"200\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Seen.</text></g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>Low sun plus glasses equals a flash a deer sees from far away. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><ul><li>Brim low, glasses shaded, turn your head slowly (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: shine fixes</summary><ul><li>Face: mask, net or paint (Tip).</li><li>Hands: thin gloves, they move the most (Tip).</li><li>Rifle and scope: matte finish or a cover, lens caps on while walking (Tip).</li><li>Phone: screen off and away when deer are close; a lit screen in shade is a flash (Tip).</li><li>Glass: shade the objective lenses of binoculars with your hand or a hood in low sun (Tip). See <a href=\"#/s/glassing/0\">Glassing</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Left: a hunter sits in the open with nothing behind him. Right: a hunter sits with his back against a big tree and brush in front, his outline lost in the background.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"16\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Sit in front of something bigger</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"60\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(100 230) scale(1.2)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><text x=\"100\" y=\"285\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Open, nothing behind</text><rect x=\"270\" y=\"80\" width=\"40\" height=\"170\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><g transform=\"translate(260 240) scale(1.3)\"><circle cx=\"-14\" cy=\"-10\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"-4\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#6b7a4a\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(300 230) scale(1.2)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#4a4030\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#4a4030\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><text x=\"300\" y=\"285\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Back to a big tree</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Back against a tree, rock or bush wider than you (Tip).</li><li>A little brush in front breaks your middle (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: seats in full</summary><ul><li>The backdrop hides your outline; the brush in front hides your hands moving (Tip).</li><li>Shade over the seat hides shine and your shadow (Tip).</li><li>Leave a clear shooting lane through the brush in front. Clear it in the off season or quietly, not on the morning (Tip).</li><li>Sit, do not stand. A seated hunter is a smaller, wider, less human shape (Tip).</li><li>Check the wind before you choose a seat: <a href=\"#/s/wind-mastery/0\">Wind mastery</a>.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"3\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Check your hunting clothes</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 3</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"In a dark room, shine a small UV flashlight on your hunting clothes.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Dark room, UV light</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"110\" width=\"120\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><path d=\"M260 140 L360 100 L360 180 Z\" fill=\"#845ef7\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\" opacity=\".5\"\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"270\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">A cheap UV flashlight</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>1.</b> Dark room, small UV flashlight.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Clothes that glow bright blue white under UV hold optical brighteners.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Look for a glow</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"80\" width=\"100\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#9c9784\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"100\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#b197fc\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"240\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#7048e8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">glow</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"270\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Bright blue white glow = brighteners</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> A blue white glow means brighteners.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Wash in a detergent without optical brighteners. Tip.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Wash without brighteners</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"90\" width=\"120\" height=\"130\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"160\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#dfe8f0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"270\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">UV free or plain detergent (Tip)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Wash in a detergent without them (Tip).</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><ul><li>Evidence is mixed. It costs little to check (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: UV in full</summary><ul><li>Deer lack the UV filter in the human lens and likely see UV better than people (75%, NDA). The 1990s retina work found little UV response; a 2014 behaviour study with 7 deer found some sensitivity (70%, search previews).</li><li>No direct test found that UV brightened clothing spooks deer (60%: not a fact). Treat it as cheap insurance, labelled Tip.</li><li>Many household detergents add optical brighteners (Tip). Read the label or test with the light.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Evenly spaced objects look man made while nature is random. Two hunters side by side make two shapes; move one at a time.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Spacing</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Even rows look man made</text><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"60,116.4 48.0,150 72.0,150\"/><rect x=\"57.6\" y=\"150\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"100,116.4 88.0,150 112.0,150\"/><rect x=\"97.6\" y=\"150\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"140,116.4 128.0,150 152.0,150\"/><rect x=\"137.6\" y=\"150\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"180,116.4 168.0,150 192.0,150\"/><rect x=\"177.6\" y=\"150\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><text x=\"220\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Nature is random</text><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"230,116.4 218.0,150 242.0,150\"/><rect x=\"227.6\" y=\"150\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"250,106.4 238.0,140 262.0,140\"/><rect x=\"247.6\" y=\"140\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"300,126.4 288.0,160 312.0,160\"/><rect x=\"297.6\" y=\"160\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"340,111.4 328.0,145 352.0,145\"/><rect x=\"337.6\" y=\"145\" width=\"4.8\" height=\"7.199999999999999\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(110 250) scale(0.7)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(170 250) scale(0.7)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><text x=\"140\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Side by side: two shapes</text><g transform=\"translate(260 250) scale(0.7)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-30\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M0 -23 V2 M0 2 L-7 18 M0 2 L7 18 M0 -16 L-9 -4 M0 -16 L9 -4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g><text x=\"330\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">One moves at a time</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\"></text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>One moves, one watches. Then swap (Tip).</li><li>Hand signals, not voices (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: two hunter craft</summary><ul><li>Moving together doubles the shapes and the noise (Tip).</li><li>The watcher keeps the animal in view and signals when its head goes up (Tip).</li><li>Agree signals at the truck: stop, down, come, deer, buck, shoot lane clear (Tip).</li><li>Safety first: zones of fire and where each of you is at all times. See <a href=\"#/s/firearm-safety/0\">Firearm safety</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Look around cover, not over it. Left, crossed: a head pokes up over the top of a bush, a round shape against the sky. Right, ticked: the hunter looks around the side of a tree trunk, low and in shade.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"240\" width=\"400\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#c9b79c\"/>\n  <ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"200\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"46\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"148\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M60 60 L140 120 M140 60 L60 120\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n  <text x=\"100\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c0392b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Over: skyline head</text>\n  <rect x=\"280\" y=\"60\" width=\"26\" height=\"182\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"250,120 293,30 336,120\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"318\" cy=\"170\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"306\" y=\"182\" width=\"30\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M340 90 l12 12 l24 -28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f6e3b\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f6e3b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Around the side</text>\n  <text x=\"100\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">stay off the skyline</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Camo hides you when you are still. Nothing hides you when you move at the wrong time.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Standing on the ridge top to glass.</li><li>Bare face and hands in low sun.</li><li>Fidgeting while a deer is looking.</li></ul></aside><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the mistakes in full</summary><ul><li>Standing on the crest to glass, skylined for a kilometre.</li><li>Bare face, bright hands and glasses catching the low October sun.</li><li>Scratching, checking the phone or lifting binoculars while a deer stares your way.</li></ul></details>","<aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Have your brother sit in three spots: open, against a tree, against a tree in shade with brush in front. Walk away 100 m and glass each one. Then swap. Score which you saw first.</p></aside><div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"fn-unseen\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"fn-unseen:0\"><span>Nothing blue in my hunting clothes</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"fn-unseen:1\"><span>Face and hands covered or shaded</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"fn-unseen:2\"><span>Scope and binocular glare checked in low sun</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"fn-unseen:3\"><span>Seat has a backdrop and shade</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"fn-unseen:4\"><span>Never glassed from the skyline today</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"fn-unseen:5\"><span>Froze every time a deer looked up</span></label></div>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Hook</th><th>Means</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SSSSSM: Shape, Shine, Shadow, Silhouette, Spacing, Movement</td><td>The six</td></tr><tr><td>Blue is a beacon, orange is grey</td><td>Deer colour vision</td></tr><tr><td>Head down, go to town. Head up, shut up</td><td>When to move</td></tr><tr><td>Bigger behind, brush in front</td><td>Seat rule</td></tr><tr><td>Skyline is a spotlight</td><td>Silhouette</td></tr><tr><td>Still beats camo</td><td>Movement matters most</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: more hooks</summary><ul><li><strong>Shine is sunrise's snitch:</strong> low sun turns any glass into a flash.</li><li><strong>Two hunters, one shape:</strong> move one at a time.</li><li><strong>Pattern over colour:</strong> blend the pattern, not the shade.</li></ul></details>","<ul><li><a href=\"https://deerassociation.com/hunters-guide-deer-vision/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">National Deer Association: the hunter's guide to deer vision</a>, read directly 2026-10-11: two cones, red green colour blind, blue disadvantage, pattern over colour, UV filter, rods <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Jacobs and others, deer cone pigments, and a 2014 Wildlife Society Bulletin behaviour study of UV sensitivity, via search previews 2026-10-11 (70 to 75%).</li><li><a href=\"https://cove.army.gov.au/article/battle-lab-camouflage-and-concealment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Australian Army CoVE: camouflage and concealment</a>, search preview 2026-10-11 (page did not load): the Seven S's <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Hunter orange rules in other places: New Brunswick, Washington and Missouri regulations, search preview 2026-10-11 <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>Hunt Mentor Rule Book, read 2026-10-11: no BC orange rule found (85%, my reading; <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span>).</li><li>Hunting application of the six: hunter experience, labelled Tip.</li></ul>"]